    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>https://runetan.github.io/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://runetan.github.io/about/</guid>
      <description>I am Zili Tan, BSc in Physics from Sun Yat-sen University and currently an MSc student in the joint Physics and Astronomy programme (Theoretical Physics track) at the University of Amsterdam. My research interests are machine learning and deep learning, with focus areas in recursive self-improvement (RSI), self-evolving systems, and AI for high-energy theory or cosmology.&#xA;E-mail: zili.tan@student.uva.nl&#xA;Education University of Amsterdam, The Netherlands — MSc Physics and Astronomy (joint degree), Theoretical Physics track, 09/2025 – 06/2027 (expected).</description>
    </item>
